WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,040
I'll make a statement here

2
00:00:01,040 --> 00:00:03,120
As long as there is someone present who can name these two fruits

3
00:00:03,120 --> 00:00:04,600
I'll give him a hundred catties for free on the spot

4
00:00:04,600 --> 00:00:06,400
If you feel that the taste is not the best in the world after a long time

5
00:00:06,400 --> 00:00:07,800
You just smashed my car.

6
00:00:07,800 --> 00:00:09,160
Hey, you have such a loud tone

7
00:00:09,160 --> 00:00:11,280
