8
00:00:11,280 --> 00:00:12,680
I can't recognize you, you're such a loser

9
00:00:12,680 --> 00:00:14,320
Strange

10
00:00:14,320 --> 00:00:17,040
The skin of this red fruit is thin and translucent, like a ruby.

11
00:00:17,040 --> 00:00:18,120
Never seen it before

12
00:00:18,120 --> 00:00:20,240
How could the grapes grow to be as big as forehead?

13
00:00:20,240 --> 00:00:21,680
Is this a plan against Peng Da?

14
00:00:21,680 --> 00:00:22,800
What's up, everyone?

15
00:00:22,800 --> 00:00:24,040
Can anyone recognize it?

16
00:00:24,040 --> 00:00:25,680
A hundred pounds of fruit can be placed here

17
00:00:25,680 --> 00:00:27,680
What kind of breed is this?

18
00:00:27,680 --> 00:00:28,680
Get out of the way

19
00:00:28,680 --> 00:00:29,960
I'll take a look

20
00:00:30,520 --> 00:00:31,960
This hundred pounds of fruit

21
00:00:31,960 --> 00:00:34,140
Today I have decided

22
00:00:34,140 --> 00:00:35,620
Professor Wang is here

23
00:00:35,620 --> 00:00:38,140
This is the most authoritative botanical statement in our province.

24
00:00:38,140 --> 00:00:39,340
The young man setting up the stall

25
00:00:39,340 --> 00:00:41,320
You have to die today

26
00:00:41,320 --> 00:00:42,520
Why did you recruit this man?

27
00:00:42,520 --> 00:00:45,480
I took his plant anatomy class for two years during my four years in college, and I got perfect marks on the exam. What if he recognized me?

28
00:00:45,480 --> 00:00:47,520
The first person in the hall to display armor on the roadside, I will be shameless

29
00:00:47,520 --> 00:00:48,440
young people

30
00:00:48,440 --> 00:00:50,280
Don’t brag too far.

31
00:00:50,280 --> 00:00:51,760
The most recorded fruit trees on earth
